{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11211720","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211720","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121172001:1":{"text":"You've been working very hard. I'm sorry, but we haven't found anything out of the ordinary near the Spirit Mound.","source_cn":"几位辛苦了。十分抱歉，我们没在鹿灵圣丘附近发现任何异常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2084D1FF1894BA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121172002:1":{"text":"Perhaps you've all uncovered something?","source_cn":"不知各位有什么发现？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB08490C0E7A6D191","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121172003:1":{"text":"Well, we didn't find the Hypogean, but there's something else... two \"somethings\", actually.","source_cn":"呃……我们没找到恶魔，但是另外有一个很大很大的发现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7405E225715454D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121172004:1":{"text":"Is that so? Well, that's good news!","source_cn":"是吗，那是好事呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07CA34E17987998C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121172005:1":{"text":"... What's wrong? Why do you look so grim?","source_cn":"……你们怎么了？为什么这副表情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33785EABDB356B7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121172006:1":{"text":"Well, it's about Talene...","source_cn":"因为，有关塔琳小姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE842B67731CAB03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173001:":{"text":"Sorry I'm late. No sign of the Hypogean up north—","source_cn":"抱歉，我回来晚了。北方没发现任何恶魔的踪迹——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x143D51CCD9B1547D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173002:":{"text":"There you are.","source_cn":"你来了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3253F97C959B6ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173003:":{"text":"Who are you?!","source_cn":"你是谁？！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C1C4748FC574A61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173004:":{"text":"Huh? There are two Talenes?!","source_cn":"咦，有两个塔琳殿下？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F53CE31539F6190","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1121172007:1":{"text":"Are you... Ah, I understand. You're an imposter created by the Hypogean.","source_cn":"你是……我明白了，是恶魔力量所做出的复制体吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BB933C566F45A35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121172008:1":{"text":"It remains to be seen who the true imposter is.","source_cn":"谁是复制体还未可知。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30D3672E03E2D5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121172009:1":{"text":"I hadn't realized I'd been affected by Hypogean magic.","source_cn":"没想到，原来我也被恶魔的力量影响了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF97356502BBEDC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121172010:1":{"text":"Chippy's little head is spinning... The two Talenes are completely identical!","source_cn":"呜哇，满满眼睛都花了……两个塔琳小姐完全一模一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC60CF71A288C291","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1121172011:1":{"text":"They each seem calm and balanced, but enraged as soon as Hypogeans are mentioned... They're completely indistinguishable!","source_cn":"交谈的时候温柔又亲切，但一旦遇到了恶魔相关的事情就雷厉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6303CE520548474D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1121172011":{"text":"They each seem calm and balanced, but enraged as soon as Hypogeans are mentioned... They're completely indistinguishable!","source_cn":"交谈的时候温柔又亲切，但一旦遇到了恶魔相关的事情就雷厉风行……已经完全分不出来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6303CE520548474D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1121172012:1":{"text":"How can we figure out who is who?!","source_cn":"咦？唉？！这、这怎么分得出来呢？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7FD037D7CB546F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1121172013:1":{"text":"They both have the same appearance and tone of voice... What about their thoughts and beliefs?","source_cn":"同样的样貌，同样的语气……思想又如何呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47E5E0958188F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1121172014:1":{"text":"Hypogeans must be vanquished from this world... would you agree?","source_cn":"恶魔的造物，应该从这个世界上消失——另一个我，你是这么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC03D516369A08C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1121172015:1":{"text":"... Indeed, I feel the exact same.","source_cn":"……果然完全一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA19E755A7D26D618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1121172016:1":{"text":"Then there is only one way forward... Fire will reveal the truth.","source_cn":"那么，我想只有一个方法了……神明所赐的，能够烧却一切邪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4AF99314944101B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:33:1121172016":{"text":"Then there is only one way forward... Fire will reveal the truth.","source_cn":"那么，我想只有一个方法了……神明所赐的，能够烧却一切邪恶的神圣火焰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4AF99314944101B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1121172017:1":{"text":"Divine flames can never harm a true Celestial. Evil will burn, and goodness shall remain.","source_cn":"神圣的火焰不会伤害真正的半神，邪恶被烧灼净化，良善依旧留存。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F37F012F0336BB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1121172018:1":{"text":"The replicant of the Hypogean will disappear, that is all.","source_cn":"恶魔的造物会消失，仅此而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA29107F9C37E29F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1121172019:1":{"text":"But then there would be a version of Talene completely gone from the world! Neither of you even knows if you truly are replicants!","source_cn":"但是那样的话，就会有一个塔琳小姐彻底从世界上消失了！你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46C9AC42A9B29424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1121172020:1":{"text":"Archon Talene, I sense no evil intent behind your words or actions.","source_cn":"两位塔琳殿下，我从你们的话语和行动中感受不到任何邪恶的意图！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7CA89F9BD0E1AA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1121172021:1":{"text":"You both seem genuine and divine in my eyes... Is there truly no other way?","source_cn":"你们在我看来，都真实又神圣……真的只有这个办法吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF270AC3FE1FD37D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1121172022:1":{"text":"Remember that the abominations of Hypogeans must not be allowed to thrive in this world. If I am such an abomination, my light must be extinguished.","source_cn":"请记住，恶魔的造物决不能存留于世，如果那恶魔的造物是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8E3669785208D70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1121172023:1":{"text":"And if I truly am the imposter, I will gladly succumb to my own cleansing fire and return to the ashes.","source_cn":"如果真的身为虚假，那么我愿意被自己的火焰烧为灰烬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61A50F03080FC358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1121172024:1":{"text":"If one wishes to protect others, then one must be willing to make difficult choices. It is through the sacrifices of others that I stand here today.","source_cn":"想要守护，就必须做出觉悟。曾经也有人立身在我身前，因为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE07A495B3BF43DF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1121172025:1":{"text":"Now, it's time to step into the light.","source_cn":"现在，是我们做出决断的时候了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B5B2697B06120BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1121172026:1":{"text":"Right... Let's do it.","source_cn":"那么……来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE019EA4F19A2B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:51:1121175001:":{"text":"Divine fire, burn!","source_cn":"神圣的火焰——燃烧吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0985FF7BFCC384CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:51:1121175002:":{"text":"Divine fire, burn!","source_cn":"神圣的火焰——燃烧吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0985FF7BFCC384CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:54:1101021165:0":{"text":"Both Talenes are willing to prove themselves, even if it means they might disappear. They stride into the divine fire, and only one Talene is left in the end.","source_cn":"两个塔琳愿意证明自身，即便就此消失也无所谓。她们走进神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBC1EC70FB991ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:0:1":{"text":"Want to purify yourself with fire?","source_cn":"你要用火焰净化自己……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x68B1B7CB7B32840F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Want to purify yourself with fire?","female":"Want to purify yourself with fire?","variant_male_record_index":"59636","variant_female_record_index":"59637","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:1:2":{"text":"Calm down, don't act hastily!","source_cn":"冷静一下，别做傻事！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0440DFCAF6A552F8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Calm down, don't act hastily!","female":"Calm down, don't act hastily!","variant_male_record_index":"59638","variant_female_record_index":"59639","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:0:1":{"text":"Was the one we first met truly her?","source_cn":"我们最开始见到的，是本人吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB94B4C7E7DDF8CB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Was the one we first met truly her?","female":"Was the one we first met truly her?","variant_male_record_index":"59630","variant_female_record_index":"59631","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:1:2":{"text":"Identify yourselves!","source_cn":"请你们验明正身吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xADE3A5C378EFDC0A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Identify yourselves!","female":"Identify yourselves!","variant_male_record_index":"59632","variant_female_record_index":"59633","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:2:3":{"text":"The real Talene must speak up!","source_cn":"请就“自己才是真身”展开辩述！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA73B82D0630770","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The real Talene must speak up!","female":"The real Talene must speak up!","variant_male_record_index":"59634","variant_female_record_index":"59635","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:55:1101021164:0":{"text":"Another Talene, who has also been out searching for the Hypogean, arrives. Finally, both Talenes appear before you at the same time.","source_cn":"另一个四处搜寻恶魔踪迹的塔琳也姗姗来迟，现在，两个塔琳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF26E2C30E0058D56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"Lyca","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"Bryon","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:身份不明的塔琳":{"text":"Talene #2","source":"身份不明的塔琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔琳":{"text":"Talene","source":"塔琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:另一个塔琳":{"text":"Talene #1","source":"另一个塔琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":50,"localized_text_count":41,"speaker_count":8}}